hrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9PPointUltrafilter}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb9PPointUltrafilter}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}p\\text{-}point\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9PPointUltrafilter}_S(U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\omega)\\land\\forall a\\in U\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(a)\\land\n\\forall F\\in U^\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in U\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\setminus F(n))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}p\\text{-}point\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9PPointUltrafilter}_S(U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\omega)\\land\\forall a\\in U\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(a)\\land\n\\forall F\\in U^\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in U\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\setminus F(n))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the free-ultrafilter convention: every countable family in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> has a pseudointersection that still belongs to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":